<title>UK: Pearson takes 50 pct stake in SA papers.</title>
<headline>Pearson takes 50 pct stake in SA papers.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pearson Plc, the international media group, has taken a 50 percent stake in South Africa's Business Day and Financial Mail newspaper, the company said on Monday.</p>
<p>It will pay approximately 11.5 million stg for the leading publications. The deal also includes the television production company African Business Channel. Pearson said the new comapny would be called African Business Media.</p>
<p>--London newspaper +44 171 5427717</p>
